\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Hierarchical training and upper-tier processing in E-HSFP\xspace  {}. (a) Clients train on local examples; edge and cloud components train on synthesized features. Class-wise moments connect the tiers, with additional scatter for optional shared-covariance synthesis. (b) Moment replay, source masking, optional accumulation, and learned aggregation prepare the Gaussian training inputs. Classification supports diagonal or full shared covariance with diagonal fallback. PRC compares independent diagonal draws from input-side and memory summaries. Solid arrows denote statistics or feature flow. Dashed arrows denote local gradients or persistent-state reuse. The replay equation omits numerical jitter. Separate model synchronization and the ISIC-2018 supervised decoder stage are omitted.}}{8}{figure.38}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:hsfp_framework}{{1}{8}{Hierarchical training and upper-tier processing in \ehsfp {}. (a) Clients train on local examples; edge and cloud components train on synthesized features. Class-wise moments connect the tiers, with additional scatter for optional shared-covariance synthesis. (b) Moment replay, source masking, optional accumulation, and learned aggregation prepare the Gaussian training inputs. Classification supports diagonal or full shared covariance with diagonal fallback. PRC compares independent diagonal draws from input-side and memory summaries. Solid arrows denote statistics or feature flow. Dashed arrows denote local gradients or persistent-state reuse. The replay equation omits numerical jitter. Separate model synchronization and the ISIC-2018 supervised decoder stage are omitted}{figure.38}{}}
\newlabel{eq:reliability_weight}{{17}{8}{Source Masking and Learned Aggregation}{equation*.43}{}}
\newlabel{eq:agg_mean_var}{{18}{8}{Source Masking and Learned Aggregation}{equation*.44}{}}
